README.md:323:Two earlier constructions were rejected rather than promoted to presets.  A conditioned random tournament was solved by the randomized greedy protector on 50/50 instances.  Tightening every favorable opponent to its planted wins stopped that attack but exposed the intended round in the opponent’s degree; a construction-aware subtree assembler then solved 20/20.  The shipped SAT-gadget construction is the response to both failures.
